-- 17-Multi-Instance-Subtask-Demo: Extend "Sub task" Inline Form with subtable/lookup/notes + JS
--
-- Form 50192 ("Sub task", TASK scene) inline-form widget (_bindingId 50544, "Sub task" /
-- "Participants" binding) gains three new components in its own subForms["50544"].rule and a
-- component-level dynamic-control script:
--   - "Reviewer" lookup field (sys_users, displays full_name) — parallel to the existing
--     "Assignee" lookup, different field key ("reviewer"), same relation binding (50545).
--   - A subTable field embedded in the inline-form, bound to the existing "People" SUB
--     binding (_bindingId 50547) — no new physical table, reuses the binding already present
--     in 00-init-kk.sql.
--   - A recordNote component with scope "RECORD" (per-row notes; valid here because this
--     inline-form is edited on a SUB binding's own designer canvas, i.e.
--     .sub-table-design-wrapper, per RecordNoteScopeSelect.vue), panel title "Sub Task Notes".
--   - Component-level dynamic control: the existing "Assignee" lookup field gets an
--     on.change handler ($FNX: body) that auto-fills the "name" input from the picked user
--     row's full_name (falls back to display_name) — demonstrates field-to-field JS linkage.
--
-- 00-init-kk.sql's embedded snapshot of form 50192 predates this save (lock_version 19,
-- 2026-08-22, folded from 05-*). This patch brings it to lock_version 20 (2026-08-24).
--
-- Idempotent: re-running is safe, this always sets the same target state.
-- =============================================================================

